{"id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-open.md","title":"Open Set","display":"df-open — Open Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-open","aliases":["58-df-open"],"display":"df-open — Open Set","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-open"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-open</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-open — Open Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal T,U\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal T,U\\in V\\)</span> (carrier, candidate topology, and candidate subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Open}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Open}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (open-subset predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open} \\vdash \\operatorname{Open}_S(U;X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\land U\\in\\mathcal T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open} \\vdash \\operatorname{Open}_S(U;X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\land U\\in\\mathcal T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Once <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is open exactly when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal T\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>In the standard topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span>, open sets are unions of open intervals</li>\n<li>The collection of open sets satisfies the topology axioms</li>\n<li>The argument order is fixed as candidate subset, carrier, topology; the topology predicate itself keeps its source order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal T,X)\">\\((\\mathcal T,X)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)$ (topology predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal T,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Open}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open} \\vdash \\operatorname{Open}_S(U;X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\land U\\in\\mathcal T","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal T,X)","display":false}],"bytes":1074,"backlinks":[{"id":"bc125fa84031840f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Open}_S$ (开集谓词, see [[../batch03/58-df-open.md]])"},{"id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Open}_S$ (开集谓词, see [[../batch03/58-df-open.md]])"},{"id":"e23ce64dcd9dfdbf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d376cd1568b41e0b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Open}_S$ (open-subset predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-open.md]])"},{"id":"dcfca1319f5eab75","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-open]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-906","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-open.md|58-df-open]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["e7514bc4cefba4f2"]}